# Only videos actually wired to an agent are committed. Raw uploads (odd names,
# unwired, or oversized) stay local. To ship a new one: rename it to the agent's
# id, set `videoUrl` in src/data/agents.ts, then add a !line below.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!demand-planning-agent.mp4
!engineering-observability-command-center.mp4
!ai-spend-optimization.mp4
!legacy-tech-modernization.mp4
